        "title": "MagSafe Monday: The Urban Fit is my favorite budget alternative to Apple’s wallet",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/17/magsafe-monday-the-urban-fit-i-my-favorite-budget-alternative-to-apples-wallet/",
