        "title": "Apple Wallet driver’s license is coming to new US state soon",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/17/apple-wallet-drivers-license-is-coming-to-new-us-state-soon/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/08/apple-wallet-ios-27-app-icon-colors.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple Wallet’s support for digital driver’s licenses keeps expanding, with North Carolina the latest state to <a href=\"https://www.ncdot.gov/dmv/license-id/nc-mobile-id/Pages/nc-mobile-id.aspx\">announce</a> that it’s launching soon. Here are the details.</p>",
