        "title": "watchOS 27 will add two new apps to your Apple Watch",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/12/watchos-27-will-add-two-new-apps-to-your-apple-watch/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/watchos-27-new-app-grid-home-screen.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">watchOS 27 is the next major software update for Apple Watch, and among its <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/09/top-watchos-27-features-that-will-enhance-your-apple-watch/\">variety of new features</a>, it will add two new apps to your Watch.</p>",
