        "title": "Apple Wallet app could get new feature to manage trade-ins",
        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/12/apple-wallet-app-could-get-new-feature-to-manage-trade-ins/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2026/06/apple-wallet-ios-27-blue.jpg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Apple regularly <a href=\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/28/heres-everything-new-for-apple-wallet-in-ios-27/\">rolls out</a> new features for Apple Wallet, and a future upgrade could center on trade-ins. Code also suggests Apple may extend how long trade-in quotes stay valid, from 14 days to 90.</p>",
        "type": "Technology",
