        "url": "https://www.oreilly.com/radar/podcast/generative-ai-in-the-real-world-ai-for-real-estate-with-ben-miller/",
        "content_text": "A typical apartment building generates data on everything from leaking toilet flappers to tenant demographics, yet most of the real estate industry still runs its analysis by hand in spreadsheets. Fundrise co-founder and RealAI CEO Ben Miller argues the missing piece isn&#8217;t a better AI model but a proprietary data layer that general-purpose tools can&#8217;t [&#8230;]",
